1. Her name "Stellaria" is derived from the idea that her audience are stars who brighten her life, and she reflects their light like the moon. (Verbatim: "I'm Stellaria because the light comes from you all being my sunshine and the sun is a star and therefore you all are the stars that brighten my life and therefore the name Stellaria works.")

2. She describes herself as a "messy punk." (Verbatim: "i'm just i'm just a messy punk")

3. She initially did not expect to be financially supported or spoiled by her audience and only hoped to make enough to survive as a VTuber. (Verbatim: "i didn't come into this expecting to be spoiled or wanting to earn like a lot... all i want is enough to like you know survive and i'll be so unbelievably happy")

4. She manages herself without a manager and believes she gives herself good advice, though sometimes assigns too much work. (Verbatim: "we all manage ourselves... i think i'm a good manager to myself i think i give myself too much work sometimes but that's on me because i am my manager")

5. She is part of a professional yet independent VTuber group that collaborates on projects while maintaining individual independence. (Verbatim: "we're independent but very professional group... we work on projects together and we work together... but we also do our own independent thing at the same time")

6. She values the group dynamic as a middle ground between solo independence and corporate agencies, helping avoid loneliness in VTubing. (Verbatim: "i feel like v that is like a very good middle ground between like independent and corporal... you're still independent but you also get to not be lonely because you got the buddies")

7. The group is working on a visual novel project that requires significant organization and collaboration. (Verbatim: "the visual novel thing wouldn't be possible if it wasn't a group there's so much to organize for all of that")

8. She expresses difficulty comprehending being financially spoiled, as her initial goal was only to afford basic survival through VTubing. (Verbatim: "peak happy was just being able to do this full time wait what like like wait what how... my brain cannot cope or understand or fully comprehend being able to like just afford things and be spoiled like this")

9. She is stubborn and suggests she might not take direction well from others. (Verbatim: "i'm a little stubborn you know i'm a little stubborn if someone tells me")

10. She jokes about having a healthy liver due to not drinking alcohol, implying she does not consume alcohol. (Verbatim: "i don't drink so it's probably in great condition like yeah") [end of text]



