1. She created a free visual novel game using Ren'Py, which took significant time to code despite not being technically complex. (Verbatim: "it took a lot of time it's not that it was difficult per se it's more just like the the kind of thing isn't like technically impressive but it does take a lot of time to to code all the stuff")

